# Call for Papers: AAI2026 – Join Us in Shaping the Future of Applied Artificial Intelligence!

We are excited to invite researchers, practitioners, and industry experts to submit their work to the **Fifth Serbian International Conference on Applied Artificial Intelligence (AAI2026)**!

---

### 📍 Lokacija i termin
* **Mesto:** Kragujevac, Serbia
* **Datum:** May 20th – 21st, 2026

---

### O konferenciji
**AAI2026** brings together the AI community to explore cutting-edge research, real-world applications, and emerging trends across the field of applied artificial intelligence. Whether your work focuses on:

* **Machine learning**
* **Computer vision**
* **NLP**
* **Healthcare AI**
* **Smart systems**
* Interdisciplinary innovations

— this is the place to share your ideas and connect with peers.

### 🚀 Why submit?
* **Present** your research to an international audience.
* **Engage** with leading experts from academia and industry.
* **Be part** of a growing AI community in Southeast Europe.
* **Publish** your work in conference proceedings.

---

### 🔗 Submission Details
Submission details and deadlines are available on the official website:
👉 [**https://aai2026.kg.ac.rs/**](https://aai2026.kg.ac.rs/)

We look forward to your contributions and to welcoming you at AAI2026!

